# DOCKERCTX-001: this file is deny-all ('*') plus an allow-list, so every
# path the Dockerfile COPYs must be re-included or the build fails with
# "failed to compute cache key: ... not found". These three were missing,
# which broke the artifact and integration-simulation jobs on the first CI
# run that ever built the image.
!RELEASE_VERSION
!RELEASE_MODE
